<changelog>
    <release version="1.12.4" revision="2aeltra1" upstream-version="1.12.4-2"
        maintainer="Tobias Koch" email="tobias.koch@gmail.com"
        date="2026-11-22 13:39:03+03:00">
        <changeset>
            <li>New upstream version, the one of Debian Forky. Debian's
            patches are listed but not applied: they are for what
            libgcrypt-config prints on Debian and for its own
            packaging</li>
            <li>New package libgcrypt-bin with dumpsexp, hmac256 and
            mpicalc, as in Debian. They were in libgcrypt20-dev</li>
            <li>libgcrypt20-dev has libgcrypt.pc</li>
            <li>The transitional package libgcrypt11-dev is gone</li>
        </changeset>
    </release>
